		{"id":"a000000000000225","type":"file","file":"Sectors/Modular Power Conversion Components.md","x":1680,"y":2040,"width":400,"height":140,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"a000000000000226","type":"text","x":1220,"y":2200,"width":860,"height":120,"text":"**Demand drivers**: AI GPU TDP 600W → 1200W+ per accelerator; liquid cooling adoption inflection 2026; nuclear PPA wave (Meta CRN, Microsoft TMI restart, Amazon Talen); MLCC volume per AI server +3x vs general-purpose."},
		{"id":"b100000000000022","type":"group","x":1180,"y":2360,"width":920,"height":480,"label":"Networking Silicon & Interconnect (sector anchors)","color":"5"},
		{"id":"a000000000000230","type":"file","file":"Sectors/Optical Networking & Photonics.md","x":1220,"y":2420,"width":440,"height":200,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"a000000000000231","type":"file","file":"Sectors/Custom Silicon & Networking Semiconductors.md","x":1680,"y":2420,"width":400,"height":200,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"a000000000000232","type":"file","file":"Sectors/Photonic Metrology.md","x":1220,"y":2640,"width":440,"height":180,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"a000000000000233","type":"text","x":1680,"y":2640,"width":400,"height":180,"text":"**Custom networking silicon = the AVGO/MRVL second leg**\n\nTomahawk/Jericho (AVGO) · Teralynx (MRVL) · DPUs · Optical retimers · CPO transition 2027+"},
		{"id":"b100000000000023","type":"group","x":2200,"y":-880,"width":960,"height":1340,"label":"Hyperscalers — CY26 capex $600–750B (+36% YoY, ~75% AI-directed)","color":"1"},
		{"id":"a000000000000300","type":"text","x":2240,"y":-820,"width":880,"height":240,"text":"## AWS — $200B CY26 capex\n\nLargest single capex spend. Trainium 3 + Inferentia 3 + Graviton (custom CPUs); fabric silicon co-developed with **MRVL**. Anthropic anchor customer; Project Rainier (400K Trainium2 cluster). Primary backer of Anthropic compute on Trainium."},
		{"id":"a000000000000301","type":"text","x":2240,"y":-560,"width":880,"height":240,"text":"## Microsoft Azure — $120B+ CY26 capex\n\nOpenAI primary cloud. **Maia AI accelerator** (3nm TSMC, MRVL-fab); **Cobalt CPU**; Three Mile Island nuclear PPA (835MW, 2028); largest CRWV GPU offtake. Capex narrative shifted from $80B → $120B+ on OpenAI Stargate fanout."},
		{"id":"a000000000000302","type":"text","x":2240,"y":-300,"width":880,"height":240,"text":"## Google GCP — $175–185B CY26 capex\n\n**TPU v7 Trillium → v8 Ironwood**; deepest vertical integration of any hyperscaler (custom silicon designed with **AVGO**). Anthropic secondary cloud. TPU = largest non-NVDA accelerator deployment globally; only true alternative to NVDA economics at scale."},
		{"id":"a000000000000303","type":"file","file":"Theses/META - Meta.md","x":2240,"y":-40,"width":880,"height":260,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"a000000000000304","type":"text","x":2240,"y":240,"width":880,"height":200,"text":"## Oracle — $50B CY26 capex\n\nFastest-growing hyperscaler off small base. **OpenAI Stargate JV** with MGX/SoftBank ($500B over 4 years, 10GW first phase Abilene TX). Primary new-entrant rival to AWS/Azure/GCP. Disproportionately exposed to single-customer (OpenAI) risk."},
		{"id":"b100000000000024","type":"group","x":2200,"y":480,"width":960,"height":440,"label":"Neoclouds & GPU-as-a-Service (second-derivative GPU buyers)","color":"1"},
		{"id":"a000000000000310","type":"file","file":"Sectors/Neoclouds & GPU-as-a-Service.md","x":2240,"y":540,"width":880,"height":200,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"a000000000000311","type":"text","x":2240,"y":760,"width":880,"height":140,"text":"**CoreWeave (CRWV, embedded in AI Compute) · Lambda · Crusoe · Nebius**\n\nFinanced via SPAC + private credit. Bridge between NVDA supply and frontier-lab demand (Anthropic, OpenAI, Mistral, xAI)."},
		{"id":"b100000000000025","type":"group","x":2200,"y":940,"width":960,"height":380,"label":"Frontier Model Labs (compute demand origination)","color":"1"},
		{"id":"a000000000000320","type":"text","x":2240,"y":1000,"width":880,"height":140,"text":"## OpenAI\n\n$300B+ revenue runrate target; Stargate JV (Oracle/MGX); primary tenant of Azure historically, now multi-cloud via Stargate. Most aggressive single-customer compute consumer."},
		{"id":"a000000000000321","type":"text","x":2240,"y":1160,"width":880,"height":140,"text":"## Anthropic · Mistral · xAI · Cohere · Inflection\n\nClaude family (Anthropic, AWS Trainium-aligned) · Mistral (sovereign EU) · xAI (Memphis Colossus 200K H100 cluster) · second-tier multi-cloud."},
		{"id":"b100000000000026","type":"group","x":3220,"y":-880,"width":920,"height":720,"label":"AI Workloads & Platforms (workload demand pull)","color":"1"},
