		{"id":"a000000000000430","type":"text","x":3220,"y":1700,"width":920,"height":260,"text":"## Software Demand Pull → Infrastructure\n\n**Each layer of this stack monetises GPU-hours differently**:\n- Frontier labs (OpenAI/Anthropic): training + inference at frontier scale\n- Enterprise SaaS (PLTR/NOW/CRWD): inference + RAG + agentic workflows\n- Consumer (APP/PINS/DUOL/META): inference at scale + recommendation models\n\nWhen workload monetisation stalls, hyperscaler capex stalls — the **inference-efficiency shock** transmits up the stack within 2–4 quarters (DeepSeek transmission Jan 2025 → Q2 2025 NVDA softness)."}
	],
